{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Echo] Season is Live!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.</strong> <strong>[Zero Burden \u00b7 Fight Hard]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kits \u00b7 Zero Consumption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Kit loss in World battles all season. Deploy your best units without worrying about the cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Challenges \u00b7 Massive Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to catch up. Complete challenges to choose any 5-Star unit from [Wrath of the Nomads] to [Lionfire]. Plus, earn rich rewards: Doctrinal Alchemy Tier V Doctrine Selection Boxes, Epic Mount Brunellus, Doctrine Spirit, Epic Hero Schematic Crates, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/68d185afcc4424269820a7c4b3fcdfb1.avif?t=1774524137\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Pass Challenges \u00b7 Reduced Difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Pass XP requirements and Season Challenges difficulty have been reduced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. [Classics Return \u00b7 A Second Chance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Modes \u00b7 Back in Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best modes from the past 26 seasons return on a weekly rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You Missed \u00b7 Claim What You Missed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Unit Banners, Unit Attire, and Mount Attire from S0 to S20 return in Battle Pass reward selection boxes. Grab exactly what you missed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/4925081c92a14de4b5026480485383fb.avif?t=1774524137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras_big/4925081c92a14de4b5026480485383fb.avif?t=1774524137 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Hero Attire from S0 to S20 returns via throwback map events. Get them as direct drops from matchmaking, or redeem them with event points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/80258177006400d57490a070ca016820.avif?t=1774524137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras_big/80258177006400d57490a070ca016820.avif?t=1774524137 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. [Balance Rework \u00b7 Experience Optimized]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shortsword &amp; Shield Skills overhaul, new Unit Tree [Soul of the Norse] unlocked directly with Honour, Knight's Shared Lineup, Inventory Expansion, and many more optimizations await!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. [Newcomer Perks \u00b7 Massive Rewards]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Starting Units:</strong> Create a character to instantly receive 13 core units. Start at zero cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero-Cost Respecs:</strong> Infinite <strong>free resets</strong> for attributes and skill points before Lv. 200.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry Mode:</strong> The Knight &amp; Squire system is live! Squires can <strong>freely borrow</strong> max-level, fully equipped units from their Knights, or even use the Knight's Shared Lineup. Graduate to receive a <strong>5-Star Unit Selection Box</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weekly Free Rotation:</strong> Experience a top-tier, max-level, fully mastered unit for free every week.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/42610c2b0629a277b3284acbc771679d.avif?t=1774524137\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conqueror\u2019s Blade \u2013 A Real-Time Tactical Warfare Game on Multi-Civilization Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a legendary Warlord and lead your troops into cinematic PvP siege warfare on ancient battlefields inspired by world civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of grand-scale sieges, fierce ACT games, or in-depth real-time strategy, <i>Conqueror\u2019s Blade</i> delivers an unmatched battlefield experience that challenges your tactical mind and rewards your leadership skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/61af2f392b5a31bd73b235379d8cd971.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/61af2f392b5a31bd73b235379d8cd971.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/61af2f392b5a31bd73b235379d8cd971.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Civilization Battlefields: A Journey Through Time and War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient battlegrounds inspired by iconic civilizations. From the cliffs of Thermopylae in Sparta to sandstorm-swept deserts along the Silk Road, and the blazing bamboo fortresses of Sengoku-era Japan \u2013 every map offers a distinct atmosphere and thrilling historical flavor. Dynamic environments and historically inspired terrain ensure that every fight feels immersive, strategic, and unforgettable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highly Diverse Siege Battles: The Ultimate Test of Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in truly massive siege battles with thousands of troops clashing on-screen. Use trebuchets to shatter walls, deploy siege towers to breach ramparts, and lead armored infantry through kill zones in fierce close-quarters combat. Each battle unfolds in three tactical phases\u2013siege preparation, front-line assault, and point conquest\u2013mirroring authentic military strategy and testing your command at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Troops Command: A Tactical Symphony of History\u2019s Finest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 100 historical troops from legendary cultures, including Spartan warriors, Viking raiders, medieval knights, Chinese dynastic warriors, samurai, winged hussars, royal guards, and deadly assassins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate troop abilities like healing, charging, shield walls, buffs, and explosive attacks to dominate the field. With new troops and maps added regularly, you\u2019ll constantly need to evolve your strategies to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/bc1e28431a4d8146eef13b92d83b3b1c.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/bc1e28431a4d8146eef13b92d83b3b1c.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/bc1e28431a4d8146eef13b92d83b3b1c.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Esports Arena: The Battlefield of the Brave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the <strong>Conqueror\u2019s Blade League (CBL) </strong>\u2013 the ultimate annual esports competition where warlords from around the world clash for glory. With over 1,000 participants and a prize pool worth tens of thousands of dollars, the CBL is where legends are forged!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Performance: Optimized for All Warlords</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advanced game engine optimization, <i>Conqueror\u2019s Blade</i> delivers stable frame rates \u2013 even in massive thousand-troops battles \u2013 on low-spec machines. Immerse yourself in the chaos of war without compromising performance.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"Valen Vanquished","name":"Valen Vanquished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"To Arms, To Arms!","name":"To Arms, To Arms!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"Mustering the Troops","name":"Mustering the Troops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"Full House","name":"Full House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"Career Commander","name":"Career Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"Lieutenant","name":"Lieutenant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d88c7526d640d115e5faccb32f1a9afbc78215af.jpg","localized_name":"Major","name":"Major","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d88c7526d640d115e5faccb32f1a9afbc78215af.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"Brigadier","name":"Brigadier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"A Praiseworthy Caparison","name":"A Praiseworthy Caparison","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"},{"icon":"d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg","localized_name":"First Blood","name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/835570/d0924d9be56cd12bdb4e473c51a468be95a281f3.jpg"}],"total":48},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/835570?t=1774524137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/3423f60bbefcb6a52d9f04fda6ed1ceb2e676183/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774524137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/ac2c2fe9a23f8abd005321ea617eb1d67385e874/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774524137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/ac2c2fe9a23f8abd005321ea617eb1d67385e874/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774524137","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gameplay consists of graphic and realistic-looking depictions of physical conflict, weapons and depictions of human injury and death. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Echo] Season is Live!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.</strong> <strong>[Zero Burden \u00b7 Fight Hard]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kits \u00b7 Zero Consumption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Kit loss in World battles all season. Deploy your best units without worrying about the cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season Challenges \u00b7 Massive Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to catch up. Complete challenges to choose any 5-Star unit from [Wrath of the Nomads] to [Lionfire]. Plus, earn rich rewards: Doctrinal Alchemy Tier V Doctrine Selection Boxes, Epic Mount Brunellus, Doctrine Spirit, Epic Hero Schematic Crates, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/68d185afcc4424269820a7c4b3fcdfb1.avif?t=1774524137\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Pass Challenges \u00b7 Reduced Difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Pass XP requirements and Season Challenges difficulty have been reduced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. [Classics Return \u00b7 A Second Chance]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Modes \u00b7 Back in Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best modes from the past 26 seasons return on a weekly rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You Missed \u00b7 Claim What You Missed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Unit Banners, Unit Attire, and Mount Attire from S0 to S20 return in Battle Pass reward selection boxes. Grab exactly what you missed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/4925081c92a14de4b5026480485383fb.avif?t=1774524137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras_big/4925081c92a14de4b5026480485383fb.avif?t=1774524137 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Hero Attire from S0 to S20 returns via throwback map events. Get them as direct drops from matchmaking, or redeem them with event points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/80258177006400d57490a070ca016820.avif?t=1774524137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras_big/80258177006400d57490a070ca016820.avif?t=1774524137 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. [Balance Rework \u00b7 Experience Optimized]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shortsword &amp; Shield Skills overhaul, new Unit Tree [Soul of the Norse] unlocked directly with Honour, Knight's Shared Lineup, Inventory Expansion, and many more optimizations await!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. [Newcomer Perks \u00b7 Massive Rewards]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Starting Units:</strong> Create a character to instantly receive 13 core units. Start at zero cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero-Cost Respecs:</strong> Infinite <strong>free resets</strong> for attributes and skill points before Lv. 200.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry Mode:</strong> The Knight &amp; Squire system is live! Squires can <strong>freely borrow</strong> max-level, fully equipped units from their Knights, or even use the Knight's Shared Lineup. Graduate to receive a <strong>5-Star Unit Selection Box</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weekly Free Rotation:</strong> Experience a top-tier, max-level, fully mastered unit for free every week.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/42610c2b0629a277b3284acbc771679d.avif?t=1774524137\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conqueror\u2019s Blade \u2013 A Real-Time Tactical Warfare Game on Multi-Civilization Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a legendary Warlord and lead your troops into cinematic PvP siege warfare on ancient battlefields inspired by world civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of grand-scale sieges, fierce ACT games, or in-depth real-time strategy, <i>Conqueror\u2019s Blade</i> delivers an unmatched battlefield experience that challenges your tactical mind and rewards your leadership skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/61af2f392b5a31bd73b235379d8cd971.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/61af2f392b5a31bd73b235379d8cd971.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/61af2f392b5a31bd73b235379d8cd971.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Civilization Battlefields: A Journey Through Time and War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ancient battlegrounds inspired by iconic civilizations. From the cliffs of Thermopylae in Sparta to sandstorm-swept deserts along the Silk Road, and the blazing bamboo fortresses of Sengoku-era Japan \u2013 every map offers a distinct atmosphere and thrilling historical flavor. Dynamic environments and historically inspired terrain ensure that every fight feels immersive, strategic, and unforgettable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=400 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/32e7b5a12db977d72c10b43a1e6afda1.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highly Diverse Siege Battles: The Ultimate Test of Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in truly massive siege battles with thousands of troops clashing on-screen. Use trebuchets to shatter walls, deploy siege towers to breach ramparts, and lead armored infantry through kill zones in fierce close-quarters combat. Each battle unfolds in three tactical phases\u2013siege preparation, front-line assault, and point conquest\u2013mirroring authentic military strategy and testing your command at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/9d7c2c83604a57f00e048b92369014b0.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Troops Command: A Tactical Symphony of History\u2019s Finest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 100 historical troops from legendary cultures, including Spartan warriors, Viking raiders, medieval knights, Chinese dynastic warriors, samurai, winged hussars, royal guards, and deadly assassins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate troop abilities like healing, charging, shield walls, buffs, and explosive attacks to dominate the field. With new troops and maps added regularly, you\u2019ll constantly need to evolve your strategies to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/bc1e28431a4d8146eef13b92d83b3b1c.poster.avif?t=1774524137\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/bc1e28431a4d8146eef13b92d83b3b1c.webm?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/extras/bc1e28431a4d8146eef13b92d83b3b1c.mp4?t=1774524137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Esports Arena: The Battlefield of the Brave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the <strong>Conqueror\u2019s Blade League (CBL) </strong>\u2013 the ultimate annual esports competition where warlords from around the world clash for glory. With over 1,000 participants and a prize pool worth tens of thousands of dollars, the CBL is where legends are forged!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Performance: Optimized for All Warlords</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advanced game engine optimization, <i>Conqueror\u2019s Blade</i> delivers stable frame rates \u2013 even in massive thousand-troops battles \u2013 on low-spec machines. Immerse yourself in the chaos of war without compromising performance.</p>","developers":["Booming Tech"],"dlc":[2654310,2654320,2654330,2654340,3360640,3379970,3379980,3379990,3380000,3642310,3642320,3642340,4260890],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/835570/2dcd3cc44129eeb5c67e553acf7a2e503f3cb191/header.jpg?t=1774524137","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92023 Booming Technology (Hangzhou)